## ─── Required ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Application profile
## Accepted values: dev | prod
PROFILE=dev

## Runtime directories
## The server will create DATA_DIRECTORY and LOG_DIRECTORY automatically on
## first run.  TEMPLATE_DIRECTORY must already exist (it is part of the source
## tree and should point to the templates/ folder).
DATA_DIRECTORY=data
LOG_DIRECTORY=logs
TEMPLATE_DIRECTORY=templates

## Supabase project credentials
## SUPABASE_URL     – Settings > API > Project URL in the Supabase dashboard.
## SUPABASE_ANON_KEY – Settings > API > Project API keys > anon / public.
SUPABASE_URL=https://xsigzjhjahsjwrynrxyy.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

## Uvicorn bind address
UVICORN_HOST=127.0.0.1
UVICORN_PORT=8000

## ─── Optional overrides (defaults shown) ────────────────────────────────────

## Allow the server to create DATA_DIRECTORY and LOG_DIRECTORY on first run.
## Set to false only if you pre-create the directories yourself.
# CREATE_DIRECTORY=true

## Number of Uvicorn worker processes.
# UVICORN_WORKERS=4
